────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
A note on the generated images
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Images under design/assets/ were generated with Google's Nano Banana Pro
(gemini-3-pro-image) from the prompts recorded in design/assets/PROMPTS.md.
They carry an invisible SynthID watermark identifying them as AI-generated.
They depict no real person, venue or event.

TURBINE is a fictional festival created as teaching material. Artist names,
copy and imagery are invented. Any resemblance to a real event or performer
is coincidental.
